    <widget class="QLabel" name="poolMiningHelp">
     <property name="text">
      <string>A pool folds many small contributions into one, tallies them as shares, and pays out to the address you name. Fair warning: the live (BOB) pool port is sized for ASICs, so a CPU will connect, work honestly, and never land a share. Solo above is the one that pays you today.</string>
